1
00:00:00,988 --> 00:00:03,318
(Amy:)Play with your phone.

2
00:00:06,894 --> 00:00:08,594
(Alfred:)Well, on that note,

3
00:00:08,595 --> 00:00:11,465
(Alfred:)there are many cultures
that have an apocalyptic flood

4
00:00:11,465 --> 00:00:12,965
(Alfred:)as part of their mythology.

5
00:00:12,966 --> 00:00:14,666
(Mary:)I don't have a mythology.

6
00:00:14,668 --> 00:00:16,398
(Mary:)I have the unerring Word of God.

7
00:00:16,403 --> 00:00:17,803
(Mary:)But that's very interesting.

8
00:00:17,805 --> 00:00:19,075
(Leonard:)Oh.

9
00:00:19,072 --> 00:00:21,172
I-I didn't mean to
disparage your faith.

10
00:00:21,175 --> 00:00:22,945
(Alfred:)Actually, I admire it.

11
00:00:22,943 --> 00:00:24,213
(Mary:)Really?
Yes.

12
00:00:24,211 --> 00:00:25,681
(Alfred:)Yes, I'm an agnostic myself,

13
00:00:25,679 --> 00:00:27,979
(Alfred:)but I have prayed,
many times, to God,

14
00:00:27,981 --> 00:00:31,521
(Alfred:)to turn my wife
into a pillar of salt.

15
00:00:32,352 --> 00:00:33,652
(Mary:)Well, He came close.

16
00:00:33,654 --> 00:00:35,684
(Mary:)Turned her into
a giant block of ice.

17
00:00:35,689 --> 00:00:38,189
(both laughing)

18
00:00:40,694 --> 00:00:42,564
(Raj:)Howard, there must be someone
at the university

19
00:00:42,563 --> 00:00:43,833
(Raj:)you can go to for help.

20
00:00:43,831 --> 00:00:45,401
(Howard:)Are you kidding?

21
00:00:45,399 --> 00:00:46,969
(Howard:)They're probably the ones
who leaked it

22
00:00:46,967 --> 00:00:48,767
(Howard:)to the military
in the first place.

23
00:00:49,903 --> 00:00:52,773
(Raj:)What about the guy
on the Channel Four News?

24
00:00:52,773 --> 00:00:54,973
(Penny:)You know,
"Four on Your Side"?

25
00:00:54,975 --> 00:00:56,875
Maybe he can be on your side.

26
00:00:58,345 --> 00:01:00,645
(Howard:)I'm being harassed
by the government,

